
Problem Statement: NST'RU (2k26) Time Capsule

Six batchmates, Priyanshi, Shourya Veer Singh, Shubh, Miraya, Jaidev, and Aryansh, are sealing a time capsule before they graduate. Each of them left a folder of belongings. Your job is to back up, sign, collect, compile, move, and clean these files so that the capsule can be sealed.
This is not as simple as it looks:
• Some names contain spaces.
• One file name starts with a dash (-).
• Some files are hidden (their names start with .).
• One wildcard can delete a file that must be kept.
• Some actions change a file that a later action needs in its original form, so the order of your commands matters.

