Actions to Perform


1. Back up Miraya's poem.

• Copy capsule/members/Miraya/poem.txt into capsule/outbox/.
• Name the copy poem backup.txt. The name contains a space.

2. Sign the poem.

• Append this exact line to capsule/members/Miraya/poem.txt:text
Signed: Miraya
Use code with caution.

3. Finalise Shourya's speech.

• Inside capsule/members/Shourya Veer Singh/, rename -draft.txt to final.txt.
• Then append this exact line to final.txt:text
Approved by Shourya Veer Singh
Use code with caution.

4. Build the letters vault.

• Inside capsule/sealed/, create the nested path batch 2026/letters/ using a single command.
• The folder batch 2026 contains a space.

5. Collect the letters.

• Copy each member's letter.txt into capsule/sealed/batch 2026/letters/.
• Each copy must be named after its owner:
	• members/Priyanshi/letter.txt → Priyanshi.txt
	• members/Shourya Veer Singh/letter.txt → Shourya Veer Singh.txt
	• members/Shubh/letter.txt → Shubh.txt
	• members/Miraya/letter.txt → Miraya.txt
	• members/Jaidev/letter.txt → Jaidev.txt
	• members/Aryansh/letter.txt → Aryansh.txt
• The original letter.txt in every member's folder must stay where it is.

6. Compile the anthology.

• Create capsule/sealed/anthology.txt containing these files, in exactly this order:
	1. Aryansh/letter.txt
	2. Jaidev/letter.txt
	3. Miraya/letter.txt
	4. Priyanshi/letter.txt
	5. Shourya Veer Singh/letter.txt
	6. Shubh/letter.txt
	7. Miraya/poem.txt (the signed version)
	8. Shourya Veer Singh/final.txt (the approved version)

7. Hide Aryansh's secret.

• Move capsule/members/Aryansh/.secret into capsule/sealed/ and rename it to .aryansh_secret in the same command.
• It must stay a hidden file.

8. Send Priyanshi's photo.

• Move capsule/members/Priyanshi/photo.raw into capsule/outbox/ and rename it to priyanshi photo.raw in the same command.

9. Clean Shubh's folder.

• Delete capsule/members/Shubh/notes.bak.
• Shubh's letter.txt must not be deleted.

10. Purge the drafts.

• Delete every visible file in capsule/drafts/ that ends in .bak, using a single wildcard command.
• Also delete the hidden file .autosave.bak.
• keep.bak.txt must NOT be deleted. Move it into capsule/outbox/ instead.
• Then remove the now-empty capsule/drafts/ directory. Do not use rm -r.

11. Rewrite the manifest.

• capsule/outbox/manifest.txt already contains an old line.
• Replace its whole content so that it contains exactly these three lines, in this order:text
CAPSULE 2026
MEMBERS 6
STATUS SEALED
Use code with caution.

12. Final sweep and seal.

• Remove Jaidev's empty folders old/sketches/ and old/ using rmdir. Do not use rm -r.
• Jaidev's folder and his letter.txt must remain.
• Create an empty hidden file capsule/sealed/.sealed.

Important Notes / Constraints

• capsule/seal.lock must not be touched. It must still exist at the end with its original content.
• poem backup.txt must NOT contain the line Signed: Miraya, but anthology.txt MUST contain it.
• Shourya's speech inside anthology.txt must include the line Approved by Shourya Veer Singh.
• All six original letter.txt files must still exist with their original content.
• Order matters. Read all the actions before you begin.
